      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَذِيرَةٌ</span></b>  [<i>A disposition to excuse</i>]. One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِنْدَهُمْ عَذِيرَةٌ</span>, meaning [<i>They have not a disposition to excuse;</i> or] <i>they do not excuse.</i> (O.) [See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَفِيرَةٌ</span>.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاذِرٌ</span>: ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِعْذَارٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
Also <i>I. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَدِيرَةٌ</span> [app. as <i>syn. with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَغِيدَةٌ</span>]. (O,
TA.)

